OL,14,     F1969. Comedy. Directed by Gene
OL,15,     FSaks. Stars Walter Matthau, Ingrid
OL,16,     FBergman & Goldie Hawn. A dentist
OL,17,     Fconvinces his assistant to pose as
OL,18,     Fhis wife so he can avoid marrying
OL,19,     Fhis girlfriend.
